  "title": "Under Armour and Bryce Harper Celebrate Philadelphia with the Launch of the Harper 11",
  "summary": "Bryce Harper and Under Armour introduce the Harper 11, the latest evolution of Harper's signature cleat designed around the idea of futuristic protection for baseball. The Harper 11 \"All Lines Lead Home\" serves as the debut colorway inspired by Philadelphia's SEPTA rail system. The All Lines Lead Home story extends to MLB All-Star Week in Philly where Under Armour will host a fan experience.",
